positions.description:
Per-position breakdown within the event — bought, bought shares, avg buy price, pnl,
realized/unrealized pnl and roi, summed across every matching wallet (so a position held
by N cohort users collapses to one entry). Serialized as a JSON array of objects.

Parsed JSON. TS shape:
Array<{
  positionId: number;
  bought: number;
  boughtShares: number;
  pnl: number;
  realizedPnl: number;
  unrealizedPnl: number;
  unrealizedShares: number;
  avgBuyPrice: number;
  roi: number;
}>

