Per-position breakdown within the event — realized cost basis, sold shares, avg buy price,
realized pnl and roi, summed across every matching wallet (so a position closed by N cohort
users collapses to one entry). Serialized as a JSON array of objects.

Parsed JSON. TS shape:
Array<{
