topEvents.description:
JSON array (up to 5) of the soonest-ending non-ended events in this series.
Each element is { id, slug, title, icon, volume, volume24h, liquidity,
openInterest, traders, trades, change24h, startDate, endDate } (all
string-typed for JSON portability). The first element matches the
firstEvent* scalars.

Parsed JSON. TS shape:
Array<{
  id: string;
  slug: string;
  title: string;
  icon: string;
  volume: string;
  volume24h: string;
  liquidity: string;
  openInterest: string;
  traders: string;
  trades: string;
  change24h: string;
  startDate: string;
  endDate: string;
}>

